comp.risks          The Risks Digest (moderated)
comp.arch           Computer architecture
comp.sources.unix   Unix sources (moderated)
comp.sources.misc   Sources
comp.text.tex       TeX
comp.protocols.tcp-ip  TCP/IP
comp.graphics       Graphics
comp.ai             Artificial intelligence
comp.society        Computers and society
